{
  "duration": 66.795125,
  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.9,
      "text": "Which modernization path fits this workload?"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.68,
      "end": 10.0,
      "text": "The Enterprise Architect specialist compares the evidence across six canonical"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.0,
      "end": 15.7,
      "text": "dispositions, through Ask EMOS and the governed assessment experience."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.7,
      "end": 18.2,
      "text": "Retain means Govern and Monitor."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.099999999999998,
      "end": 21.46,
      "text": "Retire means Safely Decommission."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.32,
      "end": 24.580000000000002,
      "text": "Rehost means Migrate Infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.92,
      "end": 27.94,
      "text": "Replatform means Transition Platform."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.939999999999998,
      "end": 30.96,
      "text": "Refactor means Transform Architecture."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.04,
      "end": 34.08,
      "text": "Repurchase means Replace and Adopt."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.08,
      "end": 42.18,
      "text": "Review the recommendation, rationale, alternatives, risks, constraints, and the"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.18,
      "end": 43.30758620689655,
      "text": "evidence that could change the decision."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.30758620689655,
      "end": 50.54,
      "text": "Target-platform claims must follow verified target-state evidence; EMOS should not"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.54,
      "end": 51.92,
      "text": "invent a cloud choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.92,
      "end": 54.38,
      "text": "New evidence can inform a follow-up assessment."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.160000000000004,
      "end": 59.4,
      "text": "Confidence does not equal readiness, and readiness does not equal approval."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.980000000000004,
      "end": 65.74000000000001,
      "text": "Next, resolve critical gaps, examine rejected alternatives, and bring the decision to"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.74000000000001,
      "end": 66.82000000000001,
      "text": "an accountable human."
    }
  ],
